^The Sandman. Песочный человек. Книга 6. Притчи и отражения"�
�V etoi knige slishkom mnogo ne tol'ko koshmarov, a voobshche vsego. Strashnykh tain i prosto chuzhikh sekretov, gorodskikh ulits, novykh domov, krepkikh napitkov, druzei, snovidenii, razgovorov do utra, krasavits i, konechno, uzhasnykh chudovishch, kuda bez nikh.
V etoi knige slishkom mnogo zhizni -- stol'ko, chto khvatit vsem personazham i ostanetsia na doliu chitatelia.
Kazhdomu prochitavshemu -- dopolnitel'nyi god k otpushchennomu sud'boi sroku.
So strogim usloviem: potratit' ego iskliuchitel'no na chudesa."�
�Neil Gaiman, Nil Geiman, Bryan Talbot, Stan Woch, P. Craig Russell, Shawn McManus, John Watkiss, Jill Thompson, Duncan Eagleson, Kent Williams"�
�London, 1898 god. Epokha korolevy Viktorii blizitsia k kontsu, nadvigaetsia XX vek. Eto vremia velikikh peremen i eta zastoia, period strogogo poriadka i nizmennogo khaosa. Eto epokha, nuzhdaiushchaiasia v zashchitnikakh!
Allan Kvotermein, kapitan Nemo, Khouli Griffin, doktor Genri Dzhekill, mister Edvard Khaid i Mina Miurrei - eti zashchitniki, i vmeste oni iavliaiutsia Ligoi Vydaiushchikhsia Dzhentl'menov.
Zaverbovannye tainstvennym Kempionom Bondom po prikazu zagadochnogo "M", eti shest' iskatelei prikliuchenii obiazany pomoch' svoei imperii v trudnuiu minutu. Teper' oni dolzhny srazit'sia so zlodeiskim Doktorom i sorvat' ego plan zakhvata mira. No vsio daleko ne tak prosto, kak kazhetsia; na delo vliiaiut inye faktory, skrytye i nezametnye. Sleduet udivitel'naia drama."�
�<>- nadzvichaino shchira rozpovid' zhinki pro dukhovne pererodzhennia i pozitivni zmini u zhitti. Avtor knigi na vlasnomu prikladi dovela, shcho navit' pislia naibil'shikh kriz mozhna ne lishe vidnovitisia, a i vidkriti v sobi novi grani, mozhlivosti ta rivni perezhivan'. Geroyinia yiyi romanu - pis'mennitsia Liz - rozcharovana u simeinomu zhitti ta znevirena v osobistomu shchasti. Zhinka vtrachaie golovne: sens ta smak do zhittia. Abi nabratisia sil ta povernutisia do zhittia, Liz virishuie podorozhuvati. Na yiyi shliakhu tri krayini: Italiia, Indoneziia ta Indiia. Tam vona vchit'sia yisti zi smakom, molitisia z vidkritim sertsem ta kokhati, nache vpershe."�
�Odin z pershikh romaniv shche zovsim iunogo avtora, v iakomu vin z divnoiu dlia iogo viku sentimental'nistiu opisuie zhorstoki zabavki tineidzheriv. Golovnii geroi, shcho priyikhav na kanikuli u malen'ke zakhidnoukrayins'ke mistechko, vidverto rozpovidaie istoriiu stosunkiv, kotri priveli do vbivstva. Kompleksi, strakhi, seksual'ni bazhannia, prikhovane i iavne supernitstvo, muzichni upodobannia i stereotipi mistsevoyi <>-- usi motivi, aktual'ni dlia svitu pidlitkiv, Deresh rozgortaie cherez amoral'nist', do iakoyi stavit'sia bez nadmirnoyi kritiki. Deiaki z geroyiv <>u ts'omu romani stali povnotsinnimi personazhami romanu <>, a pevni siuzhetni <>nabuli tam tsikavogo rozvitku."�
�Seichas vnutri vpervye tsarilo spokoistvie. Spokoistvie, gusto propitannoe nenavist'iu. Ego druz'ia, pust' byvshie gde-to slishkom surovymi, a gde-to izlishne molchalivymi, no zato nastoiashchimi, pogibli v neravnom boiu, i on ne smog priiti k nim na pomoshch'. Vragi prazdnuiut pobedu i toropiatsia dobit' gorstku nepokornykh khrabretsov, poslednii oskolok ego malen'kogo i chistogo mira, do vcherashnego dnia sushchestvovavshego vnutri bol'shogo i zagazhennogo chelovecheskoi griaz'iu Areala. No on dast vragam svoi malen'kii boi. I eto budet boi na ego pole, i po ego pravilam..." Vozdastsia li kazhdomu po zaslugam ego? Dolgozhdannaia kniga, zavershaiushchaia legendarnyi tsikl "Areal"!"�
�Picking up right where volume one left off, this collection paves the way for all future Battle Pope stories. Featuring the downfall of HellCorp and Pope's rise to local celebrity status, plus as many fights, guns, jokes, chicks and violence as you can fit in a 120-page trade paperback. This one has it all."�
�Ego zovut Oleg Gai Tregrei. On poddannyi velikoi Imperii. On kursant Vysshei imperskoi voennoi akademii. On vladeet tret'im urovnem imperskogo boevogo kompleksa i uzhe stupil na posledniuiu stupen' postizheniia Stolpa Velichiia Dukha. I on - urozhdennyi dvorianin. Voleiu sudeb on okazalsia odin v mire: chuzhom, opasnom, vrazhdebnom... ne tol'ko emu, nezvanomu prishel'tsu, no i sobstvennym obitateliam. Nashem s vami, chitatel', mire..."�
�V Las-Vegase, v razgar iadernykh ispytanii, ili Novom Orleane, v razgar Mardi Gra, Blekseda vsegda podzhidaiut neozhidannye vstrechi. No pogruzhat'sia v proshloe ili tainy samogo misticheskogo goroda Ameriki poroi prikhoditsia slishkom uzh bukval'no, chego koty strashno ne liubiat...
Roskoshnaia grafika i bogatyi kinematograficheskii stil' Guarnido v sochetanii s pisatel'skim masterstvom Kanalesa, ch'i stsenarii kritika sravnivaet s romanami Deshila Khemmeta, Reimonda Chandlera i Chestera Khaimsa, obespechili serii <>vsemirnuiu slavu i s desiatok prestizhnykh nagrad."�
�Global'nuiu katastrofu perezhili tri brata. Kapitan Stepan Rybnikov, nesshii dezhurstvo v otdele radiorazvedki komandnogo punkta. Ivan Rybnikov, otpravivshiisia s zhenoi i det'mi za gorod v to samoe vremia, kogda smertonosnyi virus obrushilsia na Rossiiu. I Nikolai Rybnikov, zhivshii v glukhoi derevne i poluchivshii klichku "Turist" za blestiashchie navyki vyzhivaniia v dikoi prirode. Im udalos' sviazat'sia v samyi poslednii moment, kogda sistemy sviazi uzhe rushilis' po vsei strane. Teper' Ivanu, Nikolaiu i sem'e Nikolaia neobkhodimo cherez territorii, zakhvachennye svirepymi mutantami i bandami opasnykh maroderov, dvigat'sia v opredelennuiu tochku na severe, ukazannuiu Stepanom, - v nadezhde, chto tam oni sumeiut vstretit' samogo Stepana i obresti zashchitu ot smertel'nykh opasnostei, podsteregaiushchikh teper' na kazhdom shagu..."�
�Nebol'shoi prigranichnyi gorodok Beshtoun. Leto, kanikuly... Tol'ko chto, neponiatno chem, zakonchilas' daliokaia Khontiiskaia voina, i teper' nespokoino na pandeiskii granitse. Na vsiakii sluchai detei iz goroda vyvoziat podal'she - v letnii lager'. Zdes' ikh i zastaiot neob'iasnimaia katastrofa - vse vzroslye libo teriaiut voliu, libo skhodiat s uma. Detiam i podrostkam prikhoditsia samim borot'sia za vyzhivanie v mire, vnezapno stavshem smertel'no opasnym..."�
�Na rubezhe tysiacheletii liudi verili v samye neveroiatnye prirodnye kataklizmy, sposobnye ugrozhat' vsemu zhivomu na planete. Odnako katastrofa, unichtozhivshaia chelovecheskuiu tsivilizatsiiu, okazalas' rukotvornoi. Strashnyi virus, vyrvavshiisia iz voennykh laboratorii, ubil bol'shuiu chast' chelovechestva, a ostal'nykh prevratil v krovozhadnykh bezumtsev. Mir prevratilsia v postapokalipticheskuiu pustyniu, v kotoroi s trudom vyzhivaiut nemnogochislennye zdorovye liudi. Plemia zarazhennykh, zhivushchee na poberezh'e kholodnogo severnogo moria, ezhegodno prinosit krovavye zhertvy Lamii, ogromnomu materomu mutantu, obitaiushchemu v okrestnostiakh. V etot raz ritualu meshaiut chuzhaki - chistye, puteshestvuiushchie na podvodnoi lodke. Kogda v stolknovenii chistykh s zarazhennymi prolivaetsia pervaia krov', situatsiia bystro vykhodit iz-pod kontrolia - i eshche bol'she ee oslozhniaet raz'iarennaia i golodnaia Lamiia, unichtozhaiushchaia na svoem puti vsio zhivoe..."�
�Kniga <>- tse rozpovid' peredovsim pro zhittia mistsevoyi rodini, shcho prozhivaie v Afganistani, v iakomu shchoino povaleno rezhim talibiv v 2001-2002 rokakh. Avtorka ne obiishla uvagoiu zhodnogo chlena tsiieyi rodini. Pro talibiv, modzhakhediv, kolishnikh koroliv Afganistanu abo pro prisutnist' SRSR ta Ameriki diznaiemosia cherez prizmu zhittia malikh, doroslikh i starikh chleniv rodini golovoiu iakikh ie vlasnik knigarni Sultan Khan. Avtor znaiomit' z yikhnimi susidami, bliz'kimi i dalekimi rodichami, zhittiam afgans'kogo mista, retel'nimi pripisami suspil'nikh vimog. Osoblivo zhorstki tsi vimogi shchodo zhinok. Osoblivo zhorstki tsi vimogi stosovno zhinok. Tsii tematitsi v knizi vidvedeno bagato storinok. Bil'shist' kharakteriv knizhki budut' dobre zrozumili ukrayins'komu chitachevi. V deiakikh sil's'kikh epizodakh mozhna vpiznati i ukrayins'ke selo. I tak samo v yikhnikh biurokratakh mozhna vpiznati i nashikh chinovnikiv. Ale za budennim zhittiepisom simpatichnikh i ne duzhe osib prostupaie zrozumila kartina rozsharpanoyi viinami krayini. Naproshuiut'sia bagato visnovkiv i porivnian'. Khiba Afganistan iedinii na planeti, iakii nibi i khoche rukhatisia vpered, ta vse zh chomus' znachna chastina krayini chinit' ts'omu shalenii opir? Same z tsiieyi knizhki ukrayins'kii chitach mig bi sobi uiaviti stupin' regresu, iakii mozhe okhopiti krayinu, kotra pochinaie eksperimentuvati z sotsial'nimi ustroiami. Priklad nedavn'oyi istoriyi Afganistanu pokazuie - Ukrayini varto zadumatisia..."�
�Kogda zhizn' stanovitsia pokhozha na kotel s chudesnym zel'em, kuda masteritsa-sud'ba kidaet vse novye i novye pripravy: volshebnye talismany i prekrasnye stikhi, krasivykh devushek i mogushchestvennykh koldunov, bezzabotnyi smekh i besprichinnuiu pechal', navernoe, sleduet polagat', chto ona udalas'. I pospeshit' skazat' spasibo, dazhe esli ne znaesh' komu. Osobenno esli ne znaesh'.
Soderzhanie:
Maks Frai. Ten' Gugimagona (povest')
Maks Frai. Prostye volshebnye veshchi (povest')"�
�Magda, don'ka uspishnogo likaria Lemberga, maie bezlich shanuval'nikiv. Ale bere taiemnii shliub iz prostim khloptsem, chim naklikaie na sebe gniv bat'kiv. Yiyi kokhanii pomiraie, a primiritisia z rodinoiu vona ne vstigaie -- do mista vkhodiat' radians'ki viis'ka, i bat'kiv rozstriliuiut'.
Na samotniu krasuniu zvertaie uvagu molodii radians'kii ofitser..."�
�A visually captivating, novelistic travelogue that chronicles the first civilian environmental cleanup expedition in Antarctica--an engaging true story told through anecdotes, journal entries, vignettes, recipes, and archival and contemporary photography.
"The first thing that comes to mind about Antarctica is not likely the food. But if you are going there, it is the second." --Wendy Trusler and Carol Devine
The Antarctic Book of Cooking and Cleaning is a unique journey through an austral summer, when a group of dedicated individuals--fifty-four people from five countries--picked up nearly three decades' worth of garbage during a three-month period in Antarctica.
In this visually captivating polar journal, Wendy Trusler and Carol Devine transport readers back twenty years and thousands of miles to Bellinghausen, the Russian research station that became their temporary home. Devine, a humanitarian who piloted the project, and Trusler, a visual artist and cook, use journal entries, letters, provision lists, recipes, and menus to document their voyage. They share pithy, insightful observations on life, food, science, politics, and the environment. Showcased throughout are modern and vintage photos and vignettes from Antarctica's short history--all of which add delightful color and warm detail to this unique book.
Trusler reveals the challenges of cooking in a makeshift kitchen during long, white nights at the bottom of the world. While the dozens of eco-tourists strive to help preserve the continent, she must figure out how to cook for all of them in the small camp kitchen, using limited ingredients. The Antarctic Book of Cooking and Cleaningincludes forty-two eclectic, tasty, and hearty recipes tinged with Russian, Chinese, and South American influences, such as Honey Oatmeal Bread, Cheese Fondue, Great Wall Dumplings, Roasted Pepper Goulash with Smoked Paprika, Roast Leg of Pork, and Frozen Chocolate Cream. All beautifully photographed, these dishes reflect the expedition's colorful cultural fabric and the astonishing raw beauty of their surroundings--a continent uniquely devoted to peace, cooperation, and science."�
�Sendmen iavliaetsia samoi proslavlennoi i voznagrazhdennoi mnozhestvom premii seriei komiksov po ochen' veskoi prichine: umnyi i glubokii epos, elegantno vypisannyi Nilom Geimanom i proilliustrirovannyi smeniaiushchimsia sostavom samykh populiarnykh khudozhnikov v sfere komiksov. Eto bogataia smes' sovremennogo mifa i temnoi fentezi, v kotoroi literatura o sovremennosti, istoricheskaia drama i legendy spleteny v edinoe tseloe. Saga o Sendmene vkliuchaet v sebia riad istorii, unikal'nykh dlia graficheskoi literatury, i vy eio nikogda ne zabudete.
V "Pritchakh i otrazheniiakh" Vladyka Snov poiavliaetsia v deviati udivitel'nykh povestiakh, kasaias' chelovecheskikh zhiznei v tumanakh proshlogo i koshmarakh nastoiashchego. Tsari i shpiony, imperatory i aktiory, vorony i vervol'fy deliatsia svoimi istoriiami, mechtami i grezami - grezami o zhizni i liubvi, vlasti i t'me."␀␀`@"	�G�z@"	�G�z@"	333333@"	q=
